From: CervantesHallo <227578309+CervantesHallo@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [Cider candidate] Try cached ready events in a closed native CPU frame

Requires0117, excludes0116/0118/0119. Not selected by a recipe.
All slow, waiting, recovery and unproved paths retain full state cancellation
protection. Shared magic3 and original acquisition/recovery are unchanged.

